+---
+title: resolve_color_default is keyword-only (override=)
+author: HarzerHeribert
+date: 2026-10-15
+cost: { minutes: 1, tokens: 24577 }
+touches:
+  - src/click/globals.py
+  - src/click/termui.py
+  - src/click/utils.py
+---
+
+## Decided
+- `click.globals.resolve_color_default` signature is `(*, override: bool | None = None) -> bool | None`. Callers pass `override=color`; behavior unchanged (explicit value wins, else ctx.color, else None).
+
+## Tried and ruled out
+- Nothing; plain rename. Tests in tests/ never call the helper directly, so no test edits were needed.
+
+## Watch out
+- Callers live in three files: utils.echo, termui.get_pager_file, termui.progressbar (pass override=color); ClickException.__init__ and termui._readline_prompt call it with no args.
+- Pyright "not accessed" warnings in utils.py (_safecall, _get_text_stream, etc.) are pre-existing, not caused by this change.
